# Add a new product dynamically
curl -X POST http://localhost:3000/admin/products \
  -H "Content-Type: application/json" \
  -d '{
    "id": "billing_management",
    "name": "Billing Management",
    "enabled": true,
    "routes": ["BillingRoute", "InvoiceRoute"],
    "roles": {
      "master": {
        "enabled": true,
        "database": {
          "host": "localhost",
          "port": 5432,
          "database": "billing_master",
          "user": "postgres",
          "password": "postgres",
          "pool": {
            "maxConnections": 20,
            "idleTimeout": 30000,
            "connectionTimeout": 5000,
            "maxUses": 7500,
            "keepAlive": true,
            "keepAliveInitialDelay": 10000,
            "statementTimeout": 30000,
            "queryTimeout": 30000
          }
        }
      },
      "client": {
        "enabled": true,
        "database": {
          "host": "localhost",
          "port": 5432,
          "database": "billing_client",
          "user": "postgres",
          "password": "postgres",
          "pool": {
            "maxConnections": 40,
            "idleTimeout": 30000,
            "connectionTimeout": 5000,
            "maxUses": 7500,
            "keepAlive": true,
            "keepAliveInitialDelay": 10000,
            "statementTimeout": 30000,
            "queryTimeout": 30000
          }
        }
      }
    }
  }'

# Add a new role to existing product
curl -X POST http://localhost:3000/admin/products/identity_access_management/roles \
  -H "Content-Type: application/json" \
  -d '{
    "roleName": "audit",
    "roleConfig": {
      "enabled": true,
      "database": {
        "host": "localhost",
        "port": 5432,
        "database": "iam_audit",
        "user": "postgres",
        "password": "postgres",
        "pool": {
          "maxConnections": 10,
          "idleTimeout": 30000,
          "connectionTimeout": 5000,
          "maxUses": 7500,
          "keepAlive": true,
          "keepAliveInitialDelay": 10000,
          "statementTimeout": 30000,
          "queryTimeout": 30000
        }
      }
    }
  }'

  How to Add a New Database:
  Option 1: JSON Config

  json
  // Just add to products.json
  {
    "id": "new_product",
    "roles": {
      "new_role": {
        "enabled": true,
        "database": { ... }
      }
    }
  }
  Option 2: API Call

  bash
  # No code changes needed!
  POST /admin/products
  POST /admin/products/{productId}/roles
  How Controllers Use It:
  typescript
  // Automatically works for any new role!
  const result = await req.db.new_role.query('SELECT * FROM table');
  NO CODE CHANGES REQUIRED FOR NEW DATABASES!